<view class="page">
  <brand-header section="首页"/>
  <view class="eyebrow">每天一点，真正用出来</view>
  <view class="title home-title">
    <view>
      <text class="marker">把学过的英语，</text>
    </view>
    <view>
      <text class="marker">真正调出来。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="muted lead">想到意思，就能说出自己的话。</view>
  <view class="card hero">
    <view class="row">
      <view class="grow">
        <view class="subtitle">今天，从这里继续</view>
        <view class="muted">从上次停下的位置继续。<view>完成后，自动安排复习或新母句。</view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <brand-mascot compact="{{true}}"/>
    </view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="start">开始今天的学习 <text class="button-arrow">→</text>
    </button>
    <view class="small muted center">今天练 5 分钟，也是在往前走。</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="demo">
    <text class="demo-dot">●</text> 当前为示例模式 · 文字训练<view class="small">反馈用于演示流程，并非对输入的真实分析。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card blue">
    <view class="subtitle">接下来的学习安排</view>
    <view wx:for="{{plan.steps}}" wx:key="title" class="plan-step">
      <view class="badge">{{index + 1}}</view>
      <view class="grow"><view class="plan-title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.detail}}</view></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!plan.steps.length}}" class="muted">当前没有待完成任务，可以自由表达或浏览学习库。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{plan.upcoming.length}}" class="label">之后到期的复习</view>
    <view wx:for="{{plan.upcoming}}" wx:key="title" class="line"><view>{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.detail}}</view></view>
    <view class="muted small plan-note">不用今天全部完成。每次从停下的位置继续；安排会随学习进度和复习结果更新。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-title">
    <text class="marker">把一句，练成一段</text>
  </view>
  <view class="grid">
    <view class="entry-card blue" bindtap="mothers">
      <view class="mini-icon blue-icon">句</view>
      <view class="subtitle">34个母句 ↗</view>
      <view class="muted">从理解到自己说出来</view>
      <view class="small muted">已收录3个 · 其余待补充</view>
    </view>
    <view class="entry-card pink" bindtap="functions">
      <view class="mini-icon pink-icon">…</view>
      <view class="subtitle">12个功能表达 ↗</view>
      <view class="muted">把一句话自然接成一段</view>
      <view class="small muted">查看用途与表达示例</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="footnote">学习数据仅保存在当前设备</view>
</view>
